                            <span class="callout-ribbon">🏆 Barber Grade Pick</span>
                            <h4 class="product-callout-title">Cremo Hair Clay Pomade Matte Finish (3.4 oz)</h4>
                            <p class="product-callout-desc">Damp hair application, natural textured tousled hold with zero greasy shine.</p>
                            <a href="https://link.amazon/B06jt1gMv" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener" class="product-callout-cta">Check Price on Amazon →</a>
