                image: "images/article4.jpg",
                author: "HaircutZonePro Lab",
                date: "Updated Oct 2025",
                rating: "9.5/10",
                content: `
                    <p>There are no overnight miracle serums, but you CAN optimize your facial hair genetics to stimulate patchy areas and accelerate terminal beard growth by up to 40%.</p>

                    <h3>The 3 Proven Beard Growth Accelerators</h3>
                    <ol>
                        <li><strong>Microneedling (0.5mm Derma Roller):</strong> Rolling twice weekly triggers localized collagen production and recruits stem-cell growth factors to sleepy facial follicles.</li>
                        <li><strong>Biotin & Castor Carrier Oil:</strong> Nourishes coarse hair fibers with ricinoleic acid and essential omega-9 fatty acids.</li>
