            'clippers': {
                title: "Best Hair Clippers & Trimmers for Beginners: 2025 Buying Guide",
                category: "Tools",
                readTime: "9 min read",
                image: "images/article5.jpg",
                author: "HaircutZonePro Lab",
                date: "Updated Oct 2025",
                rating: "9.9/10",
                content: `
                    <p>Cutting your own hair or maintaining your beard at home saves over $600 per year. But using cheap, dull clippers causes snagging, uneven lines, and razor burn.</p>

                    <h3>What to Look For in a 2025 Clipper / Trimmer</h3>
