                            <span class="callout-ribbon">✂️ Editor's Choice</span>
                            <h4 class="product-callout-title">Philips Norelco OneBlade 360 Hybrid Face & Beard Trimmer</h4>
                            <p class="product-callout-desc">Trims, edges, and shaves any length of hair without razor burn or nicks.</p>
