            'routine': {
                title: "The 5-Minute Morning Grooming Routine for Busy Modern Men",
                category: "Routines",
                readTime: "5 min read",
                image: "images/article6.jpg",
                author: "HaircutZonePro Lab",
                date: "Updated Oct 2025",
                rating: "9.6/10",
                content: `
                    <p>Looking sharp shouldn't take 45 minutes in front of the mirror. This streamlined 5-minute protocol covers hair, skin, and beard so you look dialed in every single morning.</p>

                    <div class="quick-verdict">
                        <h3>⏱️ The 5-Minute Breakdown</h3>
