                            <span class="callout-ribbon">🧴 Morning Essential</span>
                            <h4 class="product-callout-title">Cremo Thickening Shampoo with Eucalyptus (16 oz)</h4>
                            <p class="product-callout-desc">Awakens the scalp with an invigorating mint tingle and leaves hair full of volume.</p>
                            <a href="https://link.amazon/B0dykBYgD" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener" class="product-callout-cta">Check Price on Amazon →</a>
